        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lwa ng'wa Seeba",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū lūshikū lwenūlo ū lwene lwizile; lūkūbiza lūkūbakaga gītī moto mu liiko. A bikumīlīja na a babūbi pye a bose bakūbiza gītī mapalala, hūna ū lūshikū lwenūlo lūkūbanogoteja mu moto.” Alīhaya Seeba wa Būdūla bose. “Batūlekeelelwa nji nūūlū itambī dūhū biya gete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo u bing'we abo mulīkūgije ī lina lyane, ī līīmi lya būtūngīlīja līkūmufumīla līkwaakaga, līlī na būpīji ū mu manana galyo. Mukūpuluka muje hanze mukusataga gītī ndīlaanha jalugūlīlwa ha kūfuma mu kaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAL 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwane lwa kwīyīīta ī yenīyī, a babūbi mukūyūbapandagīla ha sī; bakūbiza gītī mabu mu mhambala jing'we.” Alīhaya SEEBA wa Būdūla bose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.4.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
